ind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update — New Atmosphere & Smoother Controls","summary":"Major Demo Update!We've been polishing the atmosphere, UX, and overall visual consistency of the game. Here's what's new:New Main Menu Atmosphere Added rain, thunder, and periodic lightning effects to the main menu background — it now feels much more alive and atmospheric.Reworked Level Select Menu The level selection menu has been fully redesigned to match the game's core visual style.Notes Submenu Added a new submenu to the main menu where you can read all the notes you've collected. Notes you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T12:05:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341634","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2818410-1839041357036960","game_id":"steam-2818410","kind":"announcement","title":"Bugfix #001","summary":"What has been fixed:The disc on the penultimate training level is now collected correctly. Previously, the picking sound was played, but the disc itself did not disappear. The ability to re-obtain an already collected disc when completing a level has been removed. Now, each disc is counted only once. The \"Restart\" button now correctly restarts the selected level. Previously, when re-completing a completed level, the game could take the player to the last uncompleted stage.Thank you to everyone w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T23:32:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2818410-1839041357024545","game_id":"steam-2818410","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update — 12 Languages, Linux Support, and Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello, Complex Operators!We have released a major update for the Factory Tower demo. This update makes the game accessible to more players around the world, improves the interface and visuals, expands the technical settings, and fixes several issues.And that’s not all: Factory Tower will participate in Steam Next Fest this October!NEW LEVEL SELECTIONSelecting a tower now opens a dedicated level selection menu, making it much easier to navigate between available challenges and choose the puzzle y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T16:45:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024545","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2818410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2818410":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2818410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z"},"2848940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:38Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2818410","app_id":2818410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a933acef39b49c8603f44325028879f2e28c625ade08ac9418f2899c5889b4ac","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Factory Tower는 소코반에서 영감을 받은 아이소메트릭 SF 퍼즐 게임입니다. 로봇 배달원을 이끌고 TERRA 단